# =============================================================================
# .gitignore — Pipeline to Actions Project
# =============================================================================
# This file tells Git which files and directories to EXCLUDE from version
# control. This prevents build artifacts, IDE configs, sensitive credentials,
# and temporary files from being committed to the repository.
# =============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Java / Maven Build Outputs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The 'target/' directory is where Maven compiles Java source code and
# packages the final WAR file. It is fully regenerated on every build,
# so it should never be committed to Git.
target/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE Configuration Files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These directories/files are created by popular Java IDEs (IntelliJ,
# Eclipse, VS Code). They contain user-specific settings that differ
# between developers and should not be shared.
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.classpath
.project
.settings/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating System Files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS creates .DS_Store in every directory. Windows creates Thumbs.db.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Terraform State & Working Files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Terraform state files contain sensitive info (resource IDs, IPs, etc.).
# State should be stored remotely in S3, NOT committed to Git.
# .terraform/ contains downloaded provider plugins (large binaries).
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/.terraform.lock.hcl
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.backup
terraform/*.tfplan
terraform/tfplan

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment & Credentials
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit credentials, tokens, or environment-specific config to Git.
# These should be managed through GitHub Secrets or local env variables.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
credentials

# ---------------------------------
# Other files & directories
# ---------------------------------
legendary-aws-devops-codepipeline-updated.md
.agents
